cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data, please cite it as below, along with Grant Witness for the award status it builds on."
type: dataset
title: "grantee-crosswalk: UEI and EIN for terminated federal grant recipients"
abstract: >-
  Terminated federal grant recipients from Grant Witness, keyed on their Award IDs and
  resolved to UEI (USAspending.gov) and EIN (IRS Exempt Organizations Business Master
  File), with nightly snapshots of the HHS TAGGS list of terminated grants.
authors:
  - given-names: Nathan
    family-names: Carter
repository-code: "https://github.com/nathancrtr/grantee-crosswalk"
license: [CC0-1.0, MIT]
keywords: [federal grants, grant terminations, UEI, EIN, crosswalk, HHS, TAGGS]
